## 2. HTTP服务器启动流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([HTTP服务器启动]) --> LoadConfig[加载配置文件<br/>HttpServerConfig]
    LoadConfig --> ValidateConfig{配置验证}
    ValidateConfig -->|失败| ConfigError[配置错误,启动失败]
    ValidateConfig -->|成功| InitComponents[初始化核心组件]
    
    InitComponents --> InitRouter[初始化路由器<br/>HttpRouter]
    InitRouter --> InitMiddleware[初始化中间件管理器<br/>MiddlewareManager]
    InitMiddleware --> InitThreadPool{初始化线程池}
    InitThreadPool -->|外部线程池| UseExternalPool[使用外部线程池]
    InitThreadPool -->|创建新线程池| CreateThreadPool[创建内部线程池]
    UseExternalPool --> SetupHandlers[设置默认处理器]
    CreateThreadPool --> SetupHandlers
    
    SetupHandlers --> SetupErrorHandler[设置错误处理器]
    SetupErrorHandler --> SetupNotFoundHandler[设置404处理器]
    SetupNotFoundHandler --> InitializeServer[初始化服务器<br/>不注册Channel]
    
    InitializeServer --> CreateListenSocket[创建监听套接字]
    CreateListenSocket --> ConfigureSocket[配置套接字选项<br/>REUSEADDR/NODELAY]
    ConfigureSocket --> BindSocket[绑定地址和端口]
    BindSocket --> ListenSocket[开始监听连接]
    ListenSocket --> SetRunning[设置运行状态为true]
    
    SetRunning --> StartMonitoring{启动性能监控?}
    StartMonitoring -->|是| StartTimingWheel[启动时间轮监控]
    StartMonitoring -->|否| StartEventLoopThread[启动EventLoop线程]
    StartTimingWheel --> StartEventLoopThread
    
    StartEventLoopThread --> CreateEventLoopThread[创建EventLoop线程]
    CreateEventLoopThread --> WaitEventLoopReady[等待EventLoop创建完成]
    WaitEventLoopReady --> RegisterChannel[在EventLoop线程中注册Channel]
    
    RegisterChannel --> CreateListenChannel[创建监听Channel]
    CreateListenChannel --> SetReadCallback[设置读取回调<br/>handleNewConnection]
    SetReadCallback --> EnableReading[启用读取事件]
    EnableReading --> StartEventLoop[开始事件循环]
    
    StartEventLoop --> ServerReady[服务器启动完成]
    ServerReady --> AcceptConnections[开始接受连接]
    
    %% 错误处理
    ConfigError --> Exit[退出程序]
    
    %% 时间轮监控初始化
    StartTimingWheel --> CreateTimingWheel[创建时间轮]
    CreateTimingWheel --> StartTimerTicker[启动时间轮ticker线程]
    StartTimerTicker --> SetupMonitoringTasks[设置监控任务]
    SetupMonitoringTasks --> StartEventLoopThread
    
