## 6. HTTP会话管理流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([新连接到达]) --> CreateSession[创建HTTP会话<br/>HttpSession]
    CreateSession --> ConfigureSession[配置会话参数]
    
    ConfigureSession --> SetTimeouts[设置超时参数<br/>读写/Keep-Alive]
    SetTimeouts --> SetCallbacks[设置回调函数<br/>请求处理/关闭/错误]
    SetCallbacks --> SetKeepAlive[配置Keep-Alive<br/>启用状态/最大请求数]
    SetKeepAlive --> RegisterSession[注册会话到管理器]
    
    RegisterSession --> StartSession[启动会话<br/>setState（READING）]
    StartSession --> WaitForData[等待客户端数据]
    
    WaitForData --> DataArrived{数据到达?}
    DataArrived -->|是| ReadData[读取数据到缓冲区]
    DataArrived -->|否| CheckTimeout{检查读取超时?}
    
    CheckTimeout -->|超时| TimeoutError[处理超时错误]
    CheckTimeout -->|未超时| WaitForData
    
    ReadData --> ParseRequest{解析HTTP请求}
    ParseRequest -->|成功| ProcessRequest[setState（PROCESSING）<br/>处理请求]
    ParseRequest -->|数据不完整| WaitForData
    ParseRequest -->|解析失败| BadRequestError[返回400错误]
    
    ProcessRequest --> SubmitToThreadPool[提交到线程池处理]
    SubmitToThreadPool --> ExecuteHandlers[执行中间件和处理器]
    ExecuteHandlers --> GenerateResponse[生成HTTP响应]
    
    GenerateResponse --> SendResponse[setState（WRITING）<br/>发送响应]
    SendResponse --> AsyncWrite[异步写入响应数据]
    
    AsyncWrite --> WriteComplete{写入完成?}
    WriteComplete -->|是| CheckConnection{检查连接状态}
    WriteComplete -->|否| ContinueWrite[继续写入]
    WriteComplete -->|错误| WriteError[处理写入错误]
    
    ContinueWrite --> AsyncWrite
    
    CheckConnection --> ShouldKeepAlive{应该保持连接?}
    ShouldKeepAlive -->|是| ResetForNext[resetForNextRequest（）<br/>重置会话状态]
    ShouldKeepAlive -->|否| CloseConnection[关闭连接]
    
    ResetForNext --> UpdateKeepAlive[更新Keep-Alive计数]
    UpdateKeepAlive --> CheckMaxRequests{达到最大请求数?}
    CheckMaxRequests -->|是| CloseConnection
    CheckMaxRequests -->|否| SetKeepAliveState[setState（KEEP_ALIVE）]
    SetKeepAliveState --> WaitForData
    
    %% 错误处理分支
    TimeoutError --> GenerateTimeoutResponse[生成超时响应]
    BadRequestError --> GenerateBadRequestResponse[生成400响应]
    WriteError --> LogWriteError[记录写入错误]
    
    GenerateTimeoutResponse --> CloseConnection
    GenerateBadRequestResponse --> SendResponse
    LogWriteError --> CloseConnection
    
    %% 连接关闭流程
    CloseConnection --> setStateCLOSING[setState（CLOSING）]
    setStateCLOSING --> CleanupResources[清理会话资源]
    CleanupResources --> CallCloseCallback[调用关闭回调]
    CallCloseCallback --> UnregisterSession[从管理器注销会话]
    UnregisterSession --> setStateCLOSED[setState（CLOSED）]
    setStateCLOSED --> End([会话结束])
    
    %% 会话状态图
    subgraph SessionStates["会话状态转换"]
        direction TB
        CONNECTING[CONNECTING<br/>正在建立连接]
        READING[READING<br/>正在读取请求]
        PROCESSING[PROCESSING<br/>正在处理请求]
        WRITING[WRITING<br/>正在发送响应]
        KEEP_ALIVE[KEEP_ALIVE<br/>Keep-Alive等待]
        CLOSING[CLOSING<br/>正在关闭连接]
        CLOSED[CLOSED<br/>连接已关闭]
        
        CONNECTING --> READING
        READING --> PROCESSING
        PROCESSING --> WRITING
        WRITING --> KEEP_ALIVE
        WRITING --> CLOSING
        KEEP_ALIVE --> READING
        KEEP_ALIVE --> CLOSING
        CLOSING --> CLOSED
    end
    
