## 7. 静态文件服务流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([静态文件请求]) --> CheckStaticRoute{匹配静态路由?}
    CheckStaticRoute -->|否| NotStaticFile[非静态文件请求]
    CheckStaticRoute -->|是| ExtractFilePath[提取文件路径]
    
    ExtractFilePath --> NormalizePath[标准化路径<br/>处理..和./]
    NormalizePath --> CheckPathSafety[安全性检查<br/>防目录遍历]
    
    CheckPathSafety -->|不安全| SecurityError[返回403 Forbidden]
    CheckPathSafety -->|安全| BuildFullPath[构建完整文件路径]
    
    BuildFullPath --> CheckFileExists{文件是否存在?}
    CheckFileExists -->|否| CheckDirectory{是否为目录?}
    CheckFileExists -->|是| GetFileInfo[获取文件信息]
    
    %% 文件处理分支
    GetFileInfo --> CheckPermissions{检查读取权限?}
    CheckPermissions -->|无权限| SecurityError
    CheckPermissions -->|有权限| CheckFileSize{检查文件大小}
    
    CheckFileSize -->|过大| FileTooLarge[返回413实体过大]
    CheckFileSize -->|合适| DetermineContentType[确定MIME类型]
    
    DetermineContentType --> CheckConditionalRequest{条件请求?}
    CheckConditionalRequest -->|是| HandleConditionalRequest[处理条件请求<br/>ETag/Last-Modified]
    CheckConditionalRequest -->|否| CheckRangeRequest{Range请求?}
    
    HandleConditionalRequest --> NotModified{资源未修改?}
    NotModified -->|是| Return304[返回304 Not Modified]
    NotModified -->|否| CheckRangeRequest
    
    CheckRangeRequest -->|是| HandleRangeRequest[处理Range请求]
    CheckRangeRequest -->|否| HandleNormalRequest[处理普通文件请求]
    
    %% 普通文件请求处理
    HandleNormalRequest --> ReadFileContent[读取文件内容]
    ReadFileContent --> SetFileHeaders[设置文件响应头<br/>Content-Type/Length/Cache]
    SetFileHeaders --> SendFileResponse[发送文件响应]
    
    %% Range请求处理
    HandleRangeRequest --> ParseRangeHeader[解析Range头部]
    ParseRangeHeader --> ValidateRange{Range有效?}
    ValidateRange -->|否| InvalidRange[返回416 Range不满足]
    ValidateRange -->|是| ReadFileRange[读取文件范围]
    ReadFileRange --> SetRangeHeaders[设置Range响应头<br/>Content-Range/Length]
    SetRangeHeaders --> SendRangeResponse[发送部分内容响应<br/>206 Partial Content]
    
    %% 目录处理分支
    CheckDirectory -->|否| FileNotFound[返回404 Not Found]
    CheckDirectory -->|是| FindIndexFile[查找索引文件<br/>index.html等]
    
    FindIndexFile --> IndexExists{索引文件存在?}
    IndexExists -->|是| ServeIndexFile[服务索引文件]
    IndexExists -->|否| DirectoryListingEnabled{启用目录浏览?}
    
    ServeIndexFile --> GetFileInfo
    
    DirectoryListingEnabled -->|否| SecurityError
    DirectoryListingEnabled -->|是| CheckDirectoryPermission{检查目录权限?}
    
    CheckDirectoryPermission -->|无权限| SecurityError
    CheckDirectoryPermission -->|有权限| IsEmptyDirectory{目录为空?}
    
    IsEmptyDirectory -->|是| GenerateEmptyListing[生成空目录页面]
    IsEmptyDirectory -->|否| GenerateDirectoryListing[生成目录列表页面]
    
    GenerateEmptyListing --> SendDirectoryResponse[发送目录响应]
    GenerateDirectoryListing --> AddDirectoryStats[添加目录统计信息]
    AddDirectoryStats --> SortDirectoryEntries[排序目录项<br/>目录在前,文件在后]
    SortDirectoryEntries --> GenerateHTML[生成HTML页面]
    GenerateHTML --> SendDirectoryResponse
    
    %% 缓存处理
    SetFileHeaders --> SetCacheHeaders[设置缓存头部]
    SetCacheHeaders --> IsCacheable{文件可缓存?}
    IsCacheable -->|是| SetCacheControl[设置Cache-Control<br/>ETag/Last-Modified]
    IsCacheable -->|否| SetNoCacheHeaders[设置no-cache头部]
    SetCacheControl --> SendFileResponse
    SetNoCacheHeaders --> SendFileResponse
    
    %% 性能优化
    ReadFileContent --> FileInCache{文件在缓存?}
    FileInCache -->|是| UseCachedContent[使用缓存内容]
    FileInCache -->|否| ReadFromDisk[从磁盘读取]
    ReadFromDisk --> CacheFile[缓存文件内容]
    CacheFile --> UseCachedContent
    UseCachedContent --> SetFileHeaders
    
    %% 响应发送
    SendFileResponse --> LogFileAccess[记录文件访问日志]
    SendRangeResponse --> LogFileAccess
    SendDirectoryResponse --> LogFileAccess
    LogFileAccess --> UpdateFileStats[更新文件服务统计]
    UpdateFileStats --> End([静态文件服务完成])
    
    %% 错误处理
    NotStaticFile --> End
    SecurityError --> LogSecurityError[记录安全错误]
    FileTooLarge --> LogSizeError[记录大小错误]
    FileNotFound --> LogNotFound[记录404错误]
    InvalidRange --> LogRangeError[记录Range错误]
    Return304 --> End
    LogSecurityError --> End
    LogSizeError --> End
    LogNotFound --> End
    LogRangeError --> End
    
    %% MIME类型映射示例
    subgraph MimeTypes["MIME类型映射"]
