## 9. 时间轮监控系统流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([时间轮监控启动]) --> CheckTimingWheelMode{启用时间轮模式?}
    CheckTimingWheelMode -->|是| CreateTimingWheel[创建分层时间轮<br/>HierarchicalTimingWheel]
    CheckTimingWheelMode -->|否| UseThreadMode[使用传统线程模式]
    
    CreateTimingWheel --> InitializeTimingWheel[初始化时间轮]
    InitializeTimingWheel --> ConfigureTimingWheel[配置时间轮参数]
    
    ConfigureTimingWheel --> SetTickInterval[设置tick间隔<br/>默认100ms]
    SetTickInterval --> CreateTimingLevels[创建时间层级<br/>毫秒/秒/分钟/小时]
    CreateTimingLevels --> StartTimerWheelTicker[启动时间轮ticker线程]
    
    StartTimerWheelTicker --> InitMonitoringTasks[初始化监控任务]
    InitMonitoringTasks --> RegisterStatsTimer[注册统计输出定时器]
    RegisterStatsTimer --> RegisterTimeoutChecker[注册超时检查定时器]
    RegisterTimeoutChecker --> RegisterPerformanceMonitor[注册性能监控定时器]
    
    %% 定时任务注册
    RegisterStatsTimer --> CreateStatsTask[创建统计任务<br/>每30秒执行]
    CreateStatsTask --> AddToTimingWheel1[添加到时间轮]
    
    RegisterTimeoutChecker --> CreateTimeoutTask[创建超时检查任务<br/>每10秒执行]
    CreateTimeoutTask --> AddToTimingWheel2[添加到时间轮]
    
    RegisterPerformanceMonitor --> CreatePerfTask[创建性能监控任务<br/>每5秒执行]
    CreatePerfTask --> AddToTimingWheel3[添加到时间轮]
    
    %% 时间轮主循环
    AddToTimingWheel1 --> StartMainLoop[开始时间轮主循环]
    AddToTimingWheel2 --> StartMainLoop
    AddToTimingWheel3 --> StartMainLoop
    
    StartMainLoop --> WaitForTick[等待下一个tick]
    WaitForTick --> TickOccurred[Tick发生]
    TickOccurred --> AdvanceTimingWheel[推进时间轮]
    
    AdvanceTimingWheel --> CheckExpiredTasks[检查到期任务]
    CheckExpiredTasks --> HasExpiredTask{有到期任务?}
    
    HasExpiredTask -->|否| WaitForTick
    HasExpiredTask -->|是| ExecuteExpiredTasks[执行到期任务]
    
    ExecuteExpiredTasks --> TaskType{任务类型判断}
    TaskType -->|统计任务| ExecuteStatsTask[执行统计任务]
    TaskType -->|超时检查| ExecuteTimeoutTask[执行超时检查]
    TaskType -->|性能监控| ExecutePerfTask[执行性能监控]
    
    %% 统计任务执行
    ExecuteStatsTask --> CollectServerStats[收集服务器统计信息]
    CollectServerStats --> FormatStatsOutput[格式化统计输出]
    FormatStatsOutput --> LogStatsInfo[输出统计日志]
    LogStatsInfo --> RescheduleStatsTask[重新调度统计任务]
    RescheduleStatsTask --> WaitForTick
    
    %% 超时检查任务执行
    ExecuteTimeoutTask --> CheckSessionTimeouts[检查会话超时]
    CheckSessionTimeouts --> IterateActiveSessions[遍历活跃会话]
    IterateActiveSessions --> SessionTimedOut{会话超时?}
    
    SessionTimedOut -->|是| CloseTimedOutSession[关闭超时会话]
    SessionTimedOut -->|否| CheckNextSession[检查下一个会话]
    
    CloseTimedOutSession --> LogTimeoutEvent[记录超时事件]
    LogTimeoutEvent --> CheckNextSession
    CheckNextSession --> MoreSessions{还有更多会话?}
    MoreSessions -->|是| IterateActiveSessions
    MoreSessions -->|否| RescheduleTimeoutTask[重新调度超时检查]
    RescheduleTimeoutTask --> WaitForTick
    
    %% 性能监控任务执行
    ExecutePerfTask --> CollectPerformanceData[收集性能数据]
    CollectPerformanceData --> CalculateQPS[计算QPS]
    CalculateQPS --> CalculateResponseTime[计算响应时间]
    CalculateResponseTime --> CalculateErrorRate[计算错误率]
    CalculateErrorRate --> CheckPerformanceAlerts[检查性能告警]
    
    CheckPerformanceAlerts --> PerformanceAlert{性能告警?}
    PerformanceAlert -->|是| TriggerAlert[触发性能告警]
    PerformanceAlert -->|否| UpdatePerfMetrics[更新性能指标]
    
    TriggerAlert --> LogPerformanceAlert[记录性能告警]
    LogPerformanceAlert --> UpdatePerfMetrics
    UpdatePerfMetrics --> ReschedulePerfTask[重新调度性能监控]
    ReschedulePerfTask --> WaitForTick
    
    %% 传统线程模式
    UseThreadMode --> CreateMonitoringThread[创建监控线程]
    CreateMonitoringThread --> ThreadMainLoop[线程主循环]
    ThreadMainLoop --> SleepInterval[休眠固定间隔]
    SleepInterval --> CheckStopSignal{检查停止信号?}
    CheckStopSignal -->|是| ThreadExit[线程退出]
    CheckStopSignal -->|否| ExecuteMonitoringTasks[执行监控任务]
    ExecuteMonitoringTasks --> SleepInterval
    
    %% 监控停止流程
    StopMonitoring[停止监控] --> StopTimingWheel{使用时间轮?}
    StopTimingWheel -->|是| StopTimerWheel[停止时间轮]
    StopTimingWheel -->|否| StopMonitoringThread[停止监控线程]
    
    StopTimerWheel --> CancelAllTasks[取消所有定时任务]
    CancelAllTasks --> StopTickerThread[停止ticker线程]
    StopTickerThread --> CleanupTimingWheel[清理时间轮资源]
    
    StopMonitoringThread --> SignalThreadStop[发送线程停止信号]
    SignalThreadStop --> WaitThreadJoin[等待线程结束]
    
    CleanupTimingWheel --> MonitoringStopped[监控已停止]
    WaitThreadJoin --> MonitoringStopped
    ThreadExit --> MonitoringStopped
    MonitoringStopped --> End([监控系统结束])
    
    %% 时间轮层级结构
    subgraph TimingWheelStructure["时间轮层级结构"]
        direction TB
        Level1[第1层: 毫秒级<br/>0-999ms, 100个槽位]
        Level2[第2层: 秒级<br/>0-59s, 60个槽位]
        Level3[第3层: 分钟级<br/>0-59min, 60个槽位]
        Level4[第4层: 小时级<br/>0-23h, 24个槽位]
        
        Level1 --> Level2
        Level2 --> Level3
        Level3 --> Level4
    end
    
    %% 监控任务类型
    subgraph MonitoringTasks["监控任务类型"]
        direction TB
        StatsTask[统计信息输出<br/>周期: 30秒]
        TimeoutTask[超时检查<br/>周期: 10秒]
        PerfTask[性能监控<br/>周期: 5秒]
        HealthTask[健康检查<br/>周期: 60秒]
        CleanupTask[资源清理<br/>周期: 300秒]
    end
    
    %% 样式
