## 11. WebSocket集成扩展流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([WebSocket请求到达]) --> CheckUpgradeRequest{WebSocket升级请求?}
    CheckUpgradeRequest -->|否| NormalHTTPRequest[普通HTTP请求处理]
    CheckUpgradeRequest -->|是| ValidateUpgradeHeaders[验证升级头部]
    
    ValidateUpgradeHeaders --> CheckConnection{Connection头部正确?}
    CheckConnection -->|否| BadUpgradeRequest[返回400错误]
    CheckConnection -->|是| CheckUpgrade{Upgrade头部正确?}
    
    CheckUpgrade -->|否| BadUpgradeRequest
    CheckUpgrade -->|是| CheckWebSocketKey{Sec-WebSocket-Key存在?}
    
    CheckWebSocketKey -->|否| BadUpgradeRequest
    CheckWebSocketKey -->|是| GenerateAcceptKey[生成Sec-WebSocket-Accept]
    
    GenerateAcceptKey --> CheckProtocol{检查子协议?}
    CheckProtocol -->|不支持| UnsupportedProtocol[不支持的协议]
    CheckProtocol -->|支持| CreateWebSocketResponse[创建WebSocket升级响应]
    
    CreateWebSocketResponse --> SendUpgradeResponse[发送101 Switching Protocols]
    SendUpgradeResponse --> UpgradeConnection[升级连接为WebSocket]
    
    UpgradeConnection --> CreateWebSocketHandler[创建WebSocket处理器]
    CreateWebSocketHandler --> RegisterWebSocketCallbacks[注册WebSocket回调]
    RegisterWebSocketCallbacks --> ShareEventLoop[共享HTTP服务器的EventLoop]
    
    ShareEventLoop --> StartWebSocketLoop[启动WebSocket事件循环]
    StartWebSocketLoop --> WaitForWebSocketData[等待WebSocket数据]
    
    WaitForWebSocketData --> WebSocketDataReceived{数据接收?}
    WebSocketDataReceived -->|是| ParseWebSocketFrame[解析WebSocket帧]
    WebSocketDataReceived -->|否| CheckWebSocketTimeout{检查超时?}
    
    CheckWebSocketTimeout -->|超时| CloseWebSocketConnection[关闭WebSocket连接]
    CheckWebSocketTimeout -->|未超时| WaitForWebSocketData
    
    ParseWebSocketFrame --> FrameType{帧类型判断}
    FrameType -->|文本帧| HandleTextFrame[处理文本消息]
    FrameType -->|二进制帧| HandleBinaryFrame[处理二进制消息]
    FrameType -->|关闭帧| HandleCloseFrame[处理关闭帧]
    FrameType -->|Ping帧| HandlePingFrame[处理Ping帧]
    FrameType -->|Pong帧| HandlePongFrame[处理Pong帧]
    FrameType -->|控制帧| HandleControlFrame[处理控制帧]
    
    HandleTextFrame --> ProcessMessage[处理消息内容]
    HandleBinaryFrame --> ProcessMessage
    HandleCloseFrame --> SendCloseResponse[发送关闭响应]
    HandlePingFrame --> SendPongResponse[发送Pong响应]
    HandlePongFrame --> UpdateHeartbeat[更新心跳状态]
    HandleControlFrame --> ProcessControlMessage[处理控制消息]
    
    ProcessMessage --> CallMessageHandler[调用消息处理器]
    CallMessageHandler --> GenerateResponse[生成响应消息]
    GenerateResponse --> SendWebSocketMessage[发送WebSocket消息]
    
    SendWebSocketMessage --> ContinueWebSocketLoop[继续WebSocket循环]
    SendPongResponse --> ContinueWebSocketLoop
    UpdateHeartbeat --> ContinueWebSocketLoop
    ProcessControlMessage --> ContinueWebSocketLoop
    ContinueWebSocketLoop --> WaitForWebSocketData
    
    SendCloseResponse --> WebSocketClosed[WebSocket连接关闭]
    CloseWebSocketConnection --> WebSocketClosed
    WebSocketClosed --> CleanupWebSocketResources[清理WebSocket资源]
    CleanupWebSocketResources --> End([WebSocket处理结束])
    
    %% 错误处理
    BadUpgradeRequest --> End
    UnsupportedProtocol --> End
    NormalHTTPRequest --> End
    
    %% WebSocket与HTTP服务器集成
    subgraph HTTPServerIntegration["与HTTP服务器集成"]
        direction TB
        SharedEventLoop[共享EventLoop<br/>统一事件处理]
        SharedThreadPool[共享ThreadPool<br/>异步消息处理]
        SharedLogger[共享Logger<br/>统一日志记录]
        SharedConfig[共享ConfigManager<br/>统一配置管理]
        
        SharedEventLoop --> SharedThreadPool
        SharedThreadPool --> SharedLogger
        SharedLogger --> SharedConfig
    end
    
    %% WebSocket特性支持
    subgraph WebSocketFeatures["WebSocket功能特性"]
        direction TB
        MessageTypes[消息类型支持<br/>文本/二进制/控制帧]
        Heartbeat[心跳检测<br/>Ping/Pong机制]
        Compression[消息压缩<br/>permessage-deflate]
        Extensions[扩展支持<br/>自定义扩展]
        Subprotocols[子协议支持<br/>协议协商]
        
        MessageTypes --> Heartbeat
        Heartbeat --> Compression  
        Compression --> Extensions
        Extensions --> Subprotocols
    end
    
    %% WebSocket消息流
    subgraph WebSocketMessageFlow["WebSocket消息流"]
        direction TB
        ClientMessage[客户端消息]
        FrameParsing[帧解析]
        MessageValidation[消息验证]
        BusinessLogic[业务逻辑处理]
        ResponseGeneration[响应生成]
        FrameConstruction[帧构造]
        ServerMessage[服务端消息]
        
        ClientMessage --> FrameParsing
        FrameParsing --> MessageValidation
        MessageValidation --> BusinessLogic
        BusinessLogic --> ResponseGeneration
        ResponseGeneration --> FrameConstruction
        FrameConstruction --> ServerMessage
    end
    
